Ruby-derived ordering
=====================

_ordering.py adapts the uniform intro-sort used by Enumerable#sort_by in Ruby
3.4.10 enum.c (rb_uniform_heap_down_2, rb_uniform_heapsort_2,
rb_uniform_quicksort_intro_2 and rb_uniform_intro_sort_2).
Source: https://github.com/ruby/ruby/blob/v3_4_10/enum.c

